                <p>For text, see League of Nations, Reduction of Armaments, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Supervision of the Private Manufacture and Publicity of the Manufacture of
                        Arms and Ammunition and of Implements of War</hi> (Official No.:
                    A.30.1929.IX), p. 6.</p>
